# OfficeDoc – Document Tracking System

A simple and user-friendly web application for tracking office documents and their expiry dates.

## 🌸 Features

- Add and manage office documents
- Track document expiry dates
- Search documents quickly
- View total, active, expiring, and expired documents
- Simple and clean interface

## 🛠️ Technologies

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## 🚀 Live Demo

https://shathaq13.github.io/office-doc/

## 💻 Project

This project was created as a personal portfolio project to practice front-end web development and build a practical office document management solution.

